    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d852-a1">

                <pb facs="0692" n="576" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg576"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Foreign Office</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tampico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 28, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>By instructions of the First Chief of the Constitutionalist Army, I beg to thank
                    you for the information which his excellency Secretary Bryan has given him
                    through you, regarding the naming by Licenciado Francisco Carbajal of General
                    Lauro Villar and David Gutierrez Allende as his representatives to treat with
                    Mr. Carranza regarding the unconditional surrender of the ex-federal army and
                    the powers he received from General Huerta.</p>
                <p>At the same time I take pleasure in advising you that Mr. Carranza has given
                    orders to General Pablo Gonzalez, Chief of the Army Corps of the Northeast, to
                    protect and facilitate their trip to Saltillo. I also should tell you that the
                    same orders have been repeated to San Luis Potosi, giving the names of the
                    delegates and instructing the Saltillo authorities to protect and respect
                    them.</p>
                <p>I appreciate your good will in furnishing this information and am pleased to
                    reiterate [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Isidro Fabela</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
